+## UI Tester
+
+**Run complete (minimax-m3 — static adversarial pass; no device).** Run 1: **3 P1 + 12 P2**;
+adjudicated; reworked (R1–R11); re-verified in run 2 — **ACCEPTABLE AS IT STANDS**, with two
